---
description: Tests first for new behavior and bug fixes
alwaysApply: true
---

# Tests first

- Add or extend a `*.spec.ts` and watch it fail for the missing behavior.
- Then write the minimum production code to pass.
- Assert on real results (parsed data, HTML, error codes), not mock call counts.
- Keep logic out of `src/vscode/` so Jest can run it without the editor.
- `npm run validate` must stay green (types, lint, format, tests).
